OL,3,GNEWSACollector's trading cards flight
OL,4,Astunt sets record
OL,5,
OL,6,FA collector has set a Guinness World
OL,7,FRecord by opening trading card packs
OL,8,Fwhile strapped to the wing of a vintage
OL,9,Faircraft flying over Kent.
OL,11,FCoby Bull, 33, opened seven packs in 60
OL,12,Fseconds during a wing walk at Headcorn
OL,13,FAerodrome near Ashford.
OL,15,FThe daredevil stunt took place on board
OL,16,Fa 1940s Boeing Stearman biplane flying
OL,17,Fat speeds of up to 120mph and about
OL,18,F600ft (180m) above the Kent
OL,19,Fcountryside.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,323,320,200,140,0,100
