OL,3,GNEWSACollector's trading cards flight
OL,4,Astunt sets record
OL,5,
OL,6,FBull said the excitement of breaking
OL,7,Fthe record "definitely hasn't" worn off
OL,8,Fand it was something he would remember
OL,9,Ffor the rest of his life.
